  "title": "Biological naturalism",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "9997ca26-13e3-40f4-a307-e7113d07c3ec",
      "text": "Biological naturalism is the view that mental states are as real as any other biological phenomena, such as lactation, photosynthesis, mitosis or digestion, and that like them they are caused by biological phenomena and in turn cause other biological phenomena.",
